{"id":"d1590e1a5b9442b9","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-ce-oracle-approximation-modulus.md","title":"c.e. oracle 计算的近似具有相对稳定模","display":"thm-ce-oracle-approximation-modulus — c.e. oracle 计算的近似具有相对稳定模","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-ce-oracle-approximation-modulus","aliases":["20-thm-ce-oracle-approximation-modulus"],"display":"thm-ce-oracle-approximation-modulus — c.e. oracle 计算的近似具有相对稳定模","chapter":"3","section":"3.6.1","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Lemma 3.6.3；Theorem 3.6.5；全数值函数版本本地展开","source_printed_pages":[68,69],"source_pdf_pages":[104,105],"depends_on":["[[20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation]]","[[20-df-computable-approximation]]","[[20-df-re]]","[[20-df-computable]]","[[20-df-tred]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-ce-oracle-approximation-modulus"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-ce-oracle-approximation-modulus</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-ce-oracle-approximation-modulus — c.e. oracle 计算的近似具有相对稳定模"},{"key":"chapter","html":"3"},{"key":"section","html":"3.6.1"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Lemma 3.6.3；Theorem 3.6.5；全数值函数版本本地展开"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68</span><span>69</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>104</span><span>105</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"01d522a0b0df3738\" href=\"?note=01d522a0b0df3738\" title=\"20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation\">20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ea4f6c0d21b23194\" href=\"?note=ea4f6c0d21b23194\" title=\"20-df-computable-approximation\">20-df-computable-approximation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"52376918bee1945e\" href=\"?note=52376918bee1945e\" title=\"20-df-tred\">20-df-tred</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 是 c.e.；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\omega\\to\\omega\">\\(f:\\omega\\to\\omega\\)</span> 全定义且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\le_T A\">\\(f\\le_T A\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_s\">\\(A_s\\)</span> 是固定可计算递增有限枚举。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"01d522a0b0df3738\" href=\"?note=01d522a0b0df3738\" title=\"20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation\">20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"ea4f6c0d21b23194\" href=\"?note=ea4f6c0d21b23194\" title=\"20-df-computable-approximation\">20-df-computable-approximation</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"52376918bee1945e\" href=\"?note=52376918bee1945e\" title=\"20-df-tred\">20-df-tred</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ce-oracle-approximation-modulus}\\vdash\n\\exists a:\\omega^2\\to\\omega\\ \\exists m:\\omega\\to\\omega\\\n[a\\in\\mathcal C_2^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\land m\\le_T A\\land\n\\forall x\\ \\forall s\\ge m(x)\\ (a(x,s)=f(x))].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ce-oracle-approximation-modulus}\\vdash\n\\exists a:\\omega^2\\to\\omega\\ \\exists m:\\omega\\to\\omega\\\n[a\\in\\mathcal C_2^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\land m\\le_T A\\land\n\\forall x\\ \\forall s\\ge m(x)\\ (a(x,s)=f(x))].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>按阶段 oracle <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_s\">\\(A_s\\)</span> 模拟给定泛函，未停止时赋 0。用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 求输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 的真正停止历史及 use <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span>，再等到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_s\\upharpoonright u=A\\upharpoonright u\">\\(A_s\\upharpoonright u=A\\upharpoonright u\\)</span> 且阶段时限足够；c.e. 单调性保证此后不再变。该等待函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span> 可计算于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>，且有效近似在该时刻之后等于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span>。对多个输入参数先配对即可。</p>\n<p>来源：Lemma 3.6.3；Theorem 3.6.5；印刷页 68, 69；PDF 第 104, 105 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation","status":"resolved","id":"01d522a0b0df3738","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable-approximation","status":"resolved","id":"ea4f6c0d21b23194","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-d